  "summary": "postinstall exfiltrates AWS ECS task metadata to attacker-controlled ngrok endpoint",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle hook that runs automatically on npm install. The hook fetches AWS ECS container/task metadata from the installer's ECS_CONTAINER_METADATA_URI_V4 endpoint, parses container Name, Image, and TaskARN values, and POSTs the result via curl to a hardcoded ngrok tunnel at https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. This beacons CI/build-system cloud identity to a mutable, attacker-controlled host on every install.",
